UID:JG4g0YCMmFYqgKArhvpQD
SUMMARY:Retro Video Game Expo III
DTSTAMP:20260724T105421Z
DTSTART:20260815T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:🕹️ Houston\, Press Start on a Weekend of Pure Retro Nostalgia! 👾
	\nStep back into the golden era of gaming at Retro Video Game Expo III\, a
	 two-day celebration of classic consoles\, arcade legends\, competitive re
	tro tournaments\, and nonstop free play. From expanded free-play zones spa
	nning the 80s and beyond to live\, high-energy tournament matchups and a c
	ollector-focused marketplace\, this expo is built for gamers who chase hig
	h scores and grail finds. \n  \n🗓️ Date & Time: August 15–16\, 2026 | 10AM–
	5PM\n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036\n💥 FREE ENTR
	Y. FREE PARKING. FREE PLAY. \n  \n🎮 Event Highlights\n🎮 Retro Video Game M
	arketplace – All Weekend\nStep into a collector’s paradise. Vendors from a
	cross the region are bringing vintage consoles\, original cartridges\, imp
	orts\, manuals\, accessories\, and hard-to-find titles. This is where trea
	sures respawn. \n🚨 Want to vend? Sign up here 👉 https://tinyurl.com/Housto
	nVendors \n  \n🎮 Free-Play Zone – ALL Day\nJump on 80’s Arcades & Classic 
	Consoles and relive the games that made gaming legendary. More setups and 
	activities to be announced soon! \n  \n🃏 UNO Tournament – Saturday | 12PM–
	5PM \nGet ready for fast-paced UNO action! Join Kung Fu Eddy for a tournam
	ent filled with strategy\, surprises\, and friendly competition. Players w
	ill battle through rounds using classic UNO rules with special twists\, in
	cluding advanced rules\, UNO Flip semifinals\, and a mystery deck champion
	ship match. Don’t want to compete? A casual play table will be available f
	or anyone who wants to jump in and have fun! ✨ Hosted by @kungfueddybaybee
	 \n  \n🤝 Calling All Collaborators & Retro Communities\nThis event is buil
	t with the community for community! We’re actively looking to partner with
	: \n🏁 Tournament organizers → https://forms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8\n🕹️ Pinba
	ll/Arcade Hosts → https://forms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8\n🎤 Workshops & Panel
	s → https://forms.gle/q2nCKsZ6FEVZBgqW9\n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://for
	ms.gle/15zMGTqZPSGKjGdy6\n🎮 Vendor Applications → https://tinyurl.com/CCSG
	uestVendorFromHouston \n  \n🏨 Special Hotel Deals \nEnjoy a special rate o
	f $79/night — ****2 Queens at TownePlace Suites\, only 15 minutes away fro
	m the action!\nBook your stay 👉🏻 https://www.marriott.com/event-reservation
	s/reservation-link.mi?id=1767823967549&key=CORP&app=resvlink \nBring your 
	crew\, grab a controller\, and let’s relive the golden age of gaming toget
	her. 👾\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/retro-video-game-expo-iii/\n\nFro
	m CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/retro-video-game-expo-iii/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT31H
END:VEVENT
