SUMMARY:CCS $25\,000 Riftbound Invitational Qualifier #5
DTSTAMP:20260724T105421Z
DTSTART:20260919T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:🏆 CCS Riftbound $25\,000 Invitational Qualifier #5 🏆\nWe’re ent
	ering the endgame. Qualifier #5 of the CCS $50\,000 Riftbound Invitational
	 Series is where the leaderboard tightens\, every match matters\, and mome
	ntum becomes everything. Fight for points\, pride\, and the $25\,000 guara
	nteed prize pool. \nCircuit Details → https://charliescollectibleshow.com/
	events/ccs-50000-riftbound-invitational/ \n  \n🗓 Dates: September 19 – 20 
	\n📍 Location: Charlie’s Collectible Show\, 9700 Bissonett St Unit 1500\, H
	ouston\, TX 77036 \n  \nTournament Details:\n\n🎟️ Entry Fee: $75 before Sep
	t 5\, $100 After\n🔗 Register Now! 👉 https://topdeck.gg/event/25000-houston
	-invitational-qualifier-5\n\n  \n🗂️ Format & Structure\n\nStandard Format\n
	Saturday: 8 Swiss Rounds (Best of 3)\nSunday: 2 Swiss Rounds Based on Atte
	ndance\nTop 16 → Single Elimination Finals\nTop 8 → Auto-Invites Awarded t
	o $50K Invitational! 🏆\n\n  \n💰 Guaranteed $25\,000 Prize Pool\n\n1st — $7
	\,000 + 100 pts + Invite\n2nd — $3\,500 + 80 pts + Invite\n3rd–4th — $2\,0
	00 + 65 pts + Invite\n5th–8th — $1\,000 + 50 pts + Invite\n9th–16th — $375
	 + 35 pts\n17th–32nd — $225 + 20 pts\n33rd–64th — 10 pts\n65th–128th — 5 p
	ts\n\n  \nEvent Schedule:\n🕔 Registration Opens: 9 AM \n🕔 Player Meeting (
	Day 1): 10 AM \n🕔 Day 2 Start Time: 9 AM \n  \nSide Events:\n💰 Sunday $5\,
	000 Event 💰 – Sept 20 @ 11AM ($50 Entry) \nAnother high-stakes showdown fo
	r those ready to test their skills! Register Now! 👉 https://topdeck.gg/eve
	nt/ccs-sunday-5000-riftbound-event-5 \n  \n🎲 SIDE EVENTS (All Weekend Long
	!) \nOn-demand Tournaments all weekend long and rack up Prize Wall Tickets
	!! The options are as follows: \n🔹 2-Player 1v1 \n🔹 2v2 Team Multiplayer \
	n🔹 4-Player Free-For-All \n  \n🛍️ Collectible Marketplace\nBetween rounds\,
	 enjoy access to a curated marketplace featuring: \n\nTCG singles\, sealed
	\, and accessories\nRetro video games & consoles\nAnime merch\, figures\, 
	and models\nToys and other hobby collectibles\n\nPerfect for grabbing upgr
	ades\, browsing grails\, or just hanging out between matches. \n  \n🏨 Spec
	ial Hotel Deals\nEnjoy a special rate of $79/night — ****2 Queens at Towne
	Place Suites\, only 15 minutes distance from the action! \nBook your stay 
	👉🏻 Here \n  \n🔔 IMPORTANT REMINDERS: \n\nReal names will appear on printed 
	tournament documents.\nTop 16 decklists will be published!\n\n  \n🔥 Housto
	n’s second last qualifier of the season. ****Defend your turf. Earn your i
	nvite. Leave your mark. See you at CCS Riftbound Qualifier #5!\n\nhttps://
	ccs-houston.com/events/ccs-25000-riftbound-invitational-qualifier-5/\n\nFr
	om CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/ccs-25000-riftbound-invitational-qualifi
	er-5/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT31H
END:VEVENT
